{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
The [Bb]grass withers, the [C]flower fades
But the [Dm]word of our God stands forever
He tends [Bb]his flock like a shep[C]herd
He gath[Dm]ers the lambs in his arms
And [Bb]carries them [C]close to his [Dm]heart
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Here is your God
[Bb]Here [C]is your [Dm]God
